  "body": "This spacious three-bedroom home offers breathtaking ocean views stretching back toward Rangitoto. Whether you're watching local fishermen, the ferry arriving, or simply enjoying the birdlife, these panoramic views will never get old-especially with the incredible sunsets. From your deck, you'll have front-row seats to one of nature's most spectacular shows, as dolphins and orcas frequently make their way through these waters, creating an unforgettable coastal experience.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living area seamlessly connects the dining and lounge spaces, ensuring you can take in the stunning scenery all day long. It flows effortlessly onto an expansive wraparound deck, perfect for outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing while soaking in the coastal ambiance. Large windows flood the space with natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe triple-car garage provides ample storage for multiple vehicles, a boat, or even a workshop area. Additionally, a flat grassy section offers the perfect spot for a trampoline, while a securely fenced area provides a safe space for your four-legged friend to roam freely.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master suite features a walk-in wardrobe and an en-suite bathroom. Just steps away from your morning coffee spot, you can start your day by watching the sunrise over the water.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, two generous bedrooms share a spacious bathroom, complemented by a large wet room with direct outdoor access-ideal for rinsing off after a day at the beach.\r\n\r\nWith a short five-minute walk to two stunning beaches, you'll have the luxury of choice when it comes to swimming, sunbathing, or simply relaxing by the shore. You're also just 2-3 minutes from Manly's local cafés, making it easy to pop out for your morning coffee or a bite to eat.\r\n\r\nSome photos have been digitally enhanced for marketing purposes. \r\n\r\nDon't miss out on this opportunity . Call us today for a viewing!",
